---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="AuroraCore - Aurora for People" description="Why agents need their own OS">
  <article class="glass-card space-y-4 fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 180ms;">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-[var(--color-heading)]">VISION :: AURORA FOR PEOPLE</h1>
    <p>
      Agent-native systems are not about replacing people. They are about reducing friction between decision intent
      and execution, with clearer contracts, traceability, and collaboration.
    </p>
    <p>
      AuroraCore creates a common operational plane where humans and agents can reason over the same state and goals.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
